<div class="yi-stack">
<p>Install the command line tool, then sign in:</p>
<div class="yi-code-block">
<pre tabindex="0" class="yi-code-block__body">
<code class="yi-highlight">cargo install buckle-cli
buckle login --server https://buckle.example.com</code>
</pre>
</div>
<p>With a language the header returns, and the code is coloured:</p>
<div class="yi-code-block">
<div class="yi-code-block__header">
<span class="yi-code-block__language">Shell</span>
<span class="yi-code-block__actions">
<button type="button" class="yi-button yi-button--subtle yi-button--sm yi-copy-button yi-button--icon-only" aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon">
<path d="M10 8h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-10a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-10a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2zM4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</div>
<pre tabindex="0" class="yi-code-block__body">
<code class="yi-highlight">
<span class="yi-tok-function">cargo</span> install buckle-cli
<span class="yi-tok-function">buckle</span> login --server https://buckle.example.com</code>
</pre>
